      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "AVPlayerInterstitialEventMonitorInterstitialEventWasUnscheduledEventKey, with a value that indicates which AVPlayerInterstitialEvent was unscheduled.",
      "ko": "`AVPlayerInterstitialEventMonitorInterstitialEventWasUnscheduledEventKey` — 어떤 `AVPlayerInterstitialEvent`가 unscheduled되었는지 식별하는 값.",
      "sourceHash": "64fe747d3b695047a81b2a06fe9caefbcb91d2ed4cf24538f10691978b8caf91",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "AVPlayerInterstitialEventMonitorInterstitialEventWasUnscheduledErrorKey, with an NSError value. This key will only be present if the AVPlayerInterstitialEvent was unscheduled due to an error.",
      "ko": "`AVPlayerInterstitialEventMonitorInterstitialEventWasUnscheduledErrorKey`와 `NSError` 값. 이 키는 AVPlayerInterstitialEvent가 오류로 인해 unscheduled된 경우에만 포함됩니다.",
